<h1 data-copy-en="Cherry" data-copy-zh="Cherry">Cherry</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Night-time visits, paid services and an independent personal route." data-copy-zh="夜间探访、付费服务与独立个人路线。">Night-time visits, paid services and an independent personal route.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Practical_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Finding_Cherry"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Info"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Cherry — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cherry.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Cherry — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cherry.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Cherry — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Cherry has both paid visits and a separate personal conversation route. Paid services are not a required step in that route; ordinary Talk can build affection too.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Back Alley: 21:00–24:00 and 00:00–02:00. All personal actions begin here while she is present.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>My Hours, My Rules (Known (25)) → My Kind of Work (Acquaintance (50)) → Time I Choose (Friend (100)) → Off the Clock (Close Friend (200)) → Time for Us. Complete each prior event or H2H before returning at night. Time for Us has no additional 1000-affection requirement or service fee.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">My Hours, My Rules</th><td data-label="Requirements">Back Alley; 21:00–24:00 or 00:00–02:00; Cherry Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cherry +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Time I Choose</th><td data-label="Requirements">Back Alley; 21:00–24:00 or 00:00–02:00; Cherry Friend (100); My Hours, My Rules; Cherry: My Kind of Work</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Cherry +10</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Actions_and_Rewards"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Back Alley</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Oral</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Back Alley; Beast 6</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; $150</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+2 base affection; +30 player Erotic Experience; 40% chance of Beast +1; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Doggy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Back Alley; Beast 6</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; $150</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+2 base affection; +30 player Erotic Experience; 40% chance of Beast +1; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">My Kind of Work</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Back Alley; Acquaintance (50); My Hours, My Rules</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off the Clock</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Back Alley; Close Friend (200); Time I Choose; My Kind of Work</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −25 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Time for Us</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Back Alley; Off the Clock</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+50 base affection; +60 player Erotic Experience; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Both paid services require Beast 6 and cost $150 for 45 minutes, each once per day. The later personal visit instead costs 60 minutes and 40 Energy. These actions have independent daily uses.</p><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If the paid options are missing, check Beast 6. Raising affection does not substitute for it.</li><li>For Time for Us, finish Off the Clock and return during her actual night schedule.</li><li>Personal conversations are once-only. Buying another service does not repeat or skip an H2H.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">Night-time locations</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Beast and relationship skills</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Practical_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Finding_Cherry"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Info"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Cherry 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cherry.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Cherry 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/cherry.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Cherry 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Cherry 有付费探访，也有独立的个人谈话路线。付费服务不是个人路线的必经步骤，普通交谈同样可以提升好感度。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>后巷：21:00–24:00 与 00:00–02:00。个人行动都从她在场时的后巷开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>我的时间，我的规矩 (已知 (25)) → 我喜欢的工作 (相识 (50)) → 自己选的时光 (朋友 (100)) → 私人时间 (亲密朋友 (200)) → 属于我们的时间。请完成上一段事件或谈心后再于夜间回访。「属于我们的时间」没有额外的 1000 好感度要求，也不收服务费。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">我的时间，我的规矩</th><td data-label="条件">后巷; 21:00–24:00 或 00:00–02:00; Cherry 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cherry +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">自己选的时光</th><td data-label="条件">后巷; 21:00–24:00 或 00:00–02:00; Cherry 朋友 (100); 我的时间，我的规矩; Cherry: 我喜欢的工作</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Cherry +10</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Actions_and_Rewards"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">后巷</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 4次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">口交</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">后巷; 兽性 6</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟; $150</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">基础好感度 +2；玩家情欲经验 +30；40% 概率兽性 +1；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">后入式</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">后巷; 兽性 6</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟; $150</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">基础好感度 +2；玩家情欲经验 +30；40% 概率兽性 +1；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我喜欢的工作</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">后巷; 相识 (50); 我的时间，我的规矩</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −20 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私人时间</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">后巷; 亲密朋友 (200); 自己选的时光; 我喜欢的工作</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −25 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">属于我们的时间</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">后巷; 私人时间</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −40 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">基础好感度 +50；玩家情欲经验 +60；1次/日</td></tr></tbody></table><p>两项付费服务都要求兽性 6，各花费 $150、45 分钟，每项每天一次。后续个人相聚改为消耗 60 分钟及 40 精力。这些行动分别计算每日次数。</p><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>付费选项未出现时，请检查兽性是否达到 6；好感度不能代替此条件。</li><li>若要开启个人相聚，请先完成「私人时间」，再于她实际在场的夜间时段回访。</li><li>个人谈心只能完成一次；再次购买服务不会重复或跳过谈心。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">夜间地点</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">兽性与关系技能</a></li></ul></section>
